{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2023-05-11 02:00:00', 'title': 'PASS-THROUGH VOTING ENABLING DEMOCRATIZATION OF INVESTING NEW BROADRIDGE REPORT SHOWS', 'text': 'GIVING INVESTORS A VOICE CAN BE A KEY DIFFERENTIATOR FOR ASSET MANAGEMENT FIRMS WORLDWIDE NEW YORK , MAY 11, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE RISE IN DEMAND FOR PASS-THROUGH VOTING FROM INVESTORS, COMBINED WITH SUPPORT FROM REGULATORS, IS FOSTERING THE DEMOCRATIZATION OF INVESTING IN A MAJOR WAY, ACCORDING TO A NEW REPORT BY GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER,\xa0BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS,\xa0INC. (NYSE:BR).\xa0 "PASS-THROUGH VOTING GIVES A VOICE TO INVESTMENT FUND HOLDERS," SAID DEMI DEREM, GENERAL MANAGER, INTERNATIONAL INVESTOR COMMUNICATION SOLUTIONS AT BROADRIDGE.'}